cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use yassm in your work, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "yassm: Yet Another State Space Model package"
abstract: >-
  State space models for time series analysis in Python, compiled with Numba:
  Kalman filters and smoothers, maximum likelihood and Bayesian inference,
  grid filters, particle filters, and quasi-Monte Carlo building blocks.
authors:
  - family-names: Cheung
    given-names: Kolen
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: https://github.com/ickc/yassm
url: https://ickc.github.io/yassm
keywords:
  - state space model
  - time series
  - Kalman filter
  - particle filter
  - sequential Monte Carlo
  - quasi-Monte Carlo
  - numba
